Package: geneticAnalysisR
Type: Package
Title: An R Interface to BLUPF90+ Mixed Models
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Validates and sorts pedigrees, constructs additive relationships,
    completes ordered traits by Gaussian expectation maximization, and fits
    mixed models using the external BLUPF90+ executable, including maternal
    genetic effects with optional direct-maternal covariance, and independent
    group effects.
    Supports configurable trait counts and sparse pedigree precision matrices.
    Returns breeding values and genetic parameters
    with explicit convergence and uncertainty diagnostics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, methods, tools, Matrix, processx (>= 3.8.0), curl (>= 5.0.0), openssl
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), covr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
